    <h3 itemprop="headline">The AI boom has college majors of all types dabbling in computer science</h3>
    <p itemprop="text">
      With no background in coding, Faith Maeba, a psychology major, was reluctant when her mother first suggested she enroll in classes on artificial intelligence.
      <a itemprop="url" href="/tech/2026/08/03/ai-boom-college-majors-all-types-dabbling-computer-science/"  >(Associated Press, Fast Company)</a>
