    <h3 itemprop="headline">GMKTec pairs the fastest laptop CPU ever launched with a desktop RTX5070 GPU in an impressive Neo-X1 workstation PC</h3>
    <p itemprop="text">
      GMKTec's Neo-X1 combines AMD's fastest mobile processor with desktop RTX graphics inside a compact workstation featuring liquid cooling and Wi-Fi 7.
      <a itemprop="url" href="/tech/2026/08/03/gmktec-pairs-the-fastest-laptop-cpu-ever-launched-with-a-desktop-rtx5070-gpu-in-an-impressive-neo-x1-workstation-pc/"  >(Efosa Udinmwen, TechRadar)</a>
