    <h3 itemprop="headline">Watch out</h3>
    <p itemprop="text">
      No passwords were stolen, and MFA never came into it; they walked away with access to mail, files, Teams, SharePoint, and calendars across around 120 organizations.
      <a itemprop="url" href="/tech/2026/08/04/watch-out-microsoft-login-pages-are-being-abused-as-hackers-try-and-lure-in-unlucky-victims-heres-what-to-look-out-for/"  >(Rahim Amir, TechRadar)</a>
