    <h3 itemprop="headline">Zynga&#8217;s founder shares 6 mindsets for building billion-dollar products</h3>
    <p itemprop="text">
      Below, Mark Pincus shares six key insights from his new book, Life at the Speed of Play: Launch Products People Love!.
Mark is the founder of Zynga, the pioneer of social mobile games.
      <a itemprop="url" href="/tech/2026/08/01/zynga-founder-mindsets-billion-dollar-products/"  >(Next Big Idea Club, Fast Company)</a>
