        onerror="this.parentNode.style.display='none'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <h3 itemprop="headline">Mark Zuckerberg and Priscilla Chan&#8217;s school is the latest billionaire education experiment to collapse</h3>
    <p itemprop="text">
      The Primary School, an educational facility started by Meta founder Mark Zuckerberg and his wife, Priscilla Chan, has shut its doors, becoming the latest in a series of failed attempts by billionaires and the ultra-wealthy to fix the education system.
      <a itemprop="url" href="/tech/2026/08/03/mark-zuckerberg-and-priscilla-chans-school-is-the-latest-billionaire-education-experiment-to-collapse/"  >(Chris Morris, Fast Company)</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
<div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/NewsArticle" class="card">
