        onerror="this.parentNode.style.display='none'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <h3 itemprop="headline">ChatGPT dominates Congress&#8217;s AI spending</h3>
    <p itemprop="text">
      Anthropic may have topped OpenAI as the world’s most valuable AI startup a few months ago, but when it comes to power users, Sam Altman’s company still has the edge.
ChatGPT accounted for 88% of all known spending on AI tools by the U.S.
      <a itemprop="url" href="/tech/2026/08/04/chatgpt-dominates-congresss-ai-spending/"  >(Chris Morris, Fast Company)</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
<div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/NewsArticle" class="card">
