        onerror="this.parentNode.style.display='none'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <h3 itemprop="headline">Microsoft almost gave away the keys to everyone&#8217;s Azure Cosmos DBs</h3>
    <p itemprop="text">
      Microsoft has had a narrow escape from total embarrassment: A security company uncovered a critical vulnerability that could have compromised all Azure Cosmos DB databases — both those of customers and Microsoft’s own.
      <a itemprop="url" href="/tech/2026/07/31/microsoft-almost-gave-away-the-keys-to-everyones-azure-cosmos-dbs-2/"  >(Info World)</a>
    </p>
