    <h3 itemprop="headline">The Latest: Michigan awaits outcome of fierce Democratic Senate primary</h3>
    <p itemprop="text">
      The Democratic Senate race between Rep. Haley Stevens and former public health official Abdul El-Sayed is one of the clearest tests yet of the party’s future.
      <a itemprop="url" href="/politics/2026/08/04/the-latest-michigan-democratic-senate-primary-is-test-between-progressives-and-the-establishment/"  >(Associated Press, Local 4)</a>
