        onerror="this.parentNode.style.display='none'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <h3 itemprop="headline">The Latest: Michigan awaits outcome of fierce Democratic Senate primary</h3>
    <p itemprop="text">
      The Democratic Senate race between Rep. Haley Stevens and former public health official Abdul El-Sayed is one of the clearest tests yet of the party’s future.
      <a itemprop="url" href="/politics/2026/08/04/the-latest-michigan-democratic-senate-primary-is-test-between-progressives-and-the-establishment/"  >(Associated Press, Local 4)</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
<div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/NewsArticle" class="card">
  <meta itemprop="datePublished" content="Tue, 04 Aug 2026 04:01:24 GMT">
  <meta itemprop="dateModified" content="Tue, 04 Aug 2026 04:01:24 GMT">
  <span itemprop="author" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Person">
    <meta itemprop="name" content="Mike Catalini And Nicholas Riccardi, Associated Press, KPRC 2">
  </span>
  <div class="card-content">
    <div class="image" role="presentation">
      <img src="/static15/politics/2026/08/04/what-to-watch-in-the-aug-4-primaries-michigan-senate-race-tests-democrats-path-forward.webp" alt="Takeaways from Tuesday's elections: Democrats' division on display in Michigan Senate race" itemprop="image" width="400" height="225"
        onerror="this.parentNode.style.display='none'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <h3 itemprop="headline">Takeaways from Tuesday's elections: Democrats' division on display in Michigan Senate race</h3>
    <p itemprop="text">
      Democrats face a significant challenge in Michigan's Senate primary, with U.S. Rep. Haley Stevens competing against progressive Abdul El-Sayed.
      <a itemprop="url" href="/politics/2026/08/04/what-to-watch-in-the-aug-4-primaries-michigan-senate-race-tests-democrats-path-forward/"  >(Mike Catalini And Nicholas Riccardi, Associated Press, KPRC 2)</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
</div><div class="column vcwi"><div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/NewsArticle" class="card">
  <meta itemprop="datePublished" content="Tue, 04 Aug 2026 11:18:09 GMT">
  <meta itemprop="dateModified" content="Tue, 04 Aug 2026 11:18:09 GMT">
  <span itemprop="author" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Person">
    <meta itemprop="name" content="Darlene Superville, Associated Press, Local 4">
  </span>
  <div class="card-content">
    <div class="image" role="presentation">
      <img src="/static15/politics/2026/08/04/trump-is-making-a-rare-western-trip-to-talk-about-the-economy-something-polls-show-hes-weak-on.webp" alt="Trump is making a rare Western trip to to raise cash for Republicans and talk about the economy" itemprop="image" width="400" height="225"
        onerror="this.parentNode.style.display='none'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <h3 itemprop="headline">Trump is making a rare Western trip to to raise cash for Republicans and talk about the economy</h3>
    <p itemprop="text">
      President Donald Trump is making a rare visit to California and Nevada to try to draw contrasts with Democrats on the economy and other issues.
      <a itemprop="url" href="/politics/2026/08/04/trump-is-making-a-rare-western-trip-to-talk-about-the-economy-something-polls-show-hes-weak-on/"  >(Darlene Superville, Associated Press, Local 4)</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
